A trader took a loan of ₵1,800,000.00 at an interest of $12\dfrac{1}{2}$ percent per annum. It was agreed that the loan and the interest must be paid in one year in equal monthly instalments. Calculate

(i) the interest on the loan;

(ii) the amount to be paid at the end of the year;

(iii) the monthly instalment.

The diagram is a plane figure made up of a rectangle of sides 50 cm by 28 cm and an equilateral triangle of height 24.25 cm. A circle is cut out of the rectangle as shown. If the circle touches three sides of the rectangle, calculate

(a) the perimeter of the figure;

(b) the area of the remaining portion of the figure. $\left[\text{Take } \pi = \dfrac{22}{7}\right]$
